es to send a letter to Jun. Suiseiseki tries to earn Jun's respect. Souseiseki tries to keep order in the house Kanaria tries to get into the Sakurada residence yet again. Jun and Shinku are in the background during these events.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3NS42yNltDysO6QTdSPVzU4JhwD.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"La lettera","synopsis":"Hinaichigo tries to send a letter to Jun. Suiseiseki tries to earn Jun's respect. Souseiseki tries to keep order in the house Kanaria tries to get into the Sakurada residence yet again. Jun and Shinku are in the background during these events.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3NS42yNltDysO6QTdSPVzU4JhwD.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Angelo","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3169","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"65","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"65","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42828","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"75411","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"99793","synopsis":"Megu, hospitalized with an incurable disease, enters into a contract with Suigintou. However, Megu wishes only for death and insists that she is incomplete and broken. After encountering Barasuishou, and later Shinku, it is realized that Suigintou was revived to participate in the Alice Game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPof1lkLCXpyNUmahzeNTEuA6py.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Angelo","synopsis":"Megu, hospitalized with an incurable disease, enters into a contract with Suigintou. However, Megu wishes only for death and insists that she is incomplete and broken. After encountering Barasuishou, and later Shinku, it is realized that Suigintou was revived to participate in the Alice Game.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPof1lkLCXpy